            "title": "Why OSI Systems (OSIS) Is Up 9.6% After Landing a $30 Million Naval RF Contract",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "OSI Systems, Inc. recently announced that its Security division secured an international order of about US$30,000,000 to deploy advanced RF-based communication and surveillance systems for naval operations, including upgrades to very low frequency (VLF) station architecture over a multi-year period. This naval contract underlines the company\u2019s expanding role in sophisticated defense communications, adding another long-duration project to its Security division\u2019s pipeline. We\u2019ll now examine...",
